                       "source_id":  "src-aeae4bf1",
                       "source_version":  "1.0.0",
                       "text":  "vegetative tissue highly vulnerable to blast penetration. Maintain continuous flooded water depth of 5 to 7 centimeters to inhibit spore germination from the paddy mud.",
